config X58_PRO_E_B06VL_BROAD_HARD_GATE_SEABIOS
	bool "Enable B06VL broad hard-gated SeaBIOS experiment"
	depends on X58_PRO_E_B06VK_Q_CANONICAL_CLASS_SEABIOS
	default n
	help
	  Replace B06VK's exact coupled-profile admission with one deliberately
	  broader, separately versioned experiment.  Before pass-three CSI, require
	  two identical reads matching one of seven explicit observed CPU-A0 values:
	  0x00017000, 0x00017200, 0x00017400, 0x00017600, 0x00017800,
	  0x00017a00, or 0x00017c00.  After CSI, require A0 to remain unchanged,
