	  and iPXE path while testing one additional X58 configuration-routing
	  hypothesis.  After the complete root identity preflight and before IOU0
	  start or PCI scanning, read CSRCFG 00:14.0 IOHBUSNO at direct PCIEXBAR
	  address 0xe00a010a.  Accept only 0x0000 or the vendor-observed 0x0100;
	  write the complete documented 0x0100 value only for 0x0000 and require
	  an exact readback before continuing.

	  Direct PCIEXBAR reads record the 01:0d.0 and 02:0d.0 alias identities
	  before and after that write.  The documented LCFGBUS and GCFGBUS base
	  and limit bytes are telemetry only.  After root 00:03.0 receives its
	  temporary secondary bus number, B06VO compares legacy-CF8 and direct-
	  PCIEXBAR reads of secondary:00.0 at 0, 1, 10 and 100 milliseconds, then
	  invokes the unchanged standard PCI scanner.

	  B06VO adds no bridge-control reset, Link Control/retrain, link-capability,
	  GPU, interrupt, or payload write.  A post-write alias may remain and a
	  GPU may still be absent; both are measurements rather than reasons to
	  add another hardware hypothesis to this image.

