	default n
	help
	  Add the default-off `irqprobe pit` ROMMON experiment.  With the existing
	  one-operation WRITE unlock, it first proves that PIT channel 0 raises
	  master-PIC IRR0 while IRQ0 remains masked.  It then installs a temporary
