	default n
	help
	  Preserve B06VQ's complete guarded memory, IOH, PCIe, LAPIC, USB,
	  Radeon-VBIOS, SeaBIOS and iPXE path. Before PCI enumeration, accept
	  only either the observed dual-controller IDE reset identity or this
